<title>CANADA: Newcourt Credit in C$150 mln debt offer.</title>
<headline>Newcourt Credit in C$150 mln debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newcourt Credit Group Inc said on Monday that it agreed to complete a C$150 million bought deal offering of series B debentures.</p>
<p>The debentures have a 6.45 percent interest coupon and mature on June 28, 2002, Newcourt said.</p>
<p>The deal is being underwritten by a syndicate led by Nesbitt Burns Inc.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
